## Summary of the endpoint

`POST /api/owners` is handled by **`OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner(...)`** (the class is mapped at `/api`, and the operation path is `/owners` from the generated `OwnersApi` interface). The v2 controller only serves `GET /api/owners/page`, so it is not involved. There is **no `@InitBinder`/`WebDataBinder`, no custom validator on the owner path, and no `@PrePersist`/entity lifecycle callback** on `Owner` or `Person`. The only `ConstraintValidator` in the repo (`PetAgeValidator`) applies to pets, not owners.

---

