The response DTO `OwnerDto` (`/home/daniel/sandbox/target/generated-sources/openapi/.../dto/OwnerDto.java`) carries the same input constraints plus read-only derived fields (`id`, `selfLink`, `displayName`, `salutation`, `initials`, `telephoneDisplay`, `customerCode`, `householdId`, `identityKey`, `namesakeCount`, `fiscalYear`, `membershipNumber`, `membershipPoints` `@Min(0)`, `membershipLevel` `@Min(1)@Max(4)`, `checkDigit` `@Min(0)@Max(9)`, `locality`, `timezone`, `contactPreference`, `ageBand`, `bulkSignupWarning`, `deleted`, `possibleDuplicate`, `possibleDuplicateOf` `@Min(0)`, `pets` `@Valid`).

