## 4. The persistent entity and its constraints

**`/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/model/Owner.java`** — `@Entity @Table(name="owners")`, extends `Person`. Bean Validation annotations on fields (these apply when Hibernate flushes, since the entity itself is validated on persist by the JPA/Hibernate validator):

